You rearrange everything on the bed[atCamp
    |roll
], gathering up some blankets and wrapping them around Ryn as best you can: as ever, you want to make sure your chilly elf has a chance to get nice and warm. And that doesn't just mean blankets: once the two of you are ensconced in your comfy little nest, you hold her gently [pc.hasTail
    |and let your [pc.tail][pc.hasWings
        | and one of your wings
    ] wrap around her
    |and let [pc.hasWings
