    ]
]. This is a <i>real</i> snuggle, one meant to relax your [etheryn.married
    |wife
    |elven lover
] as much as possible so she can really open up.

And it all pours out[etheryn.highConfidence
    | in a rush
    |, hesitantly at first but with increasing confidence as she goes on
]. [flags.WC_CLEAR
    |Ryn takes her monarchical responsibilities very seriously, [etheryn.lowConfidence
        |which makes it feel even more crushing to her that she doesn't think she has what it takes to be a true queen. [etheryn.crowned
