Fortunately, you've got a nice view facing Etheryn as she dozes beside you. It's a wonder she didn't wake up when you were moving before — or maybe she did, and that's why she's sleeping so soundly now. Whatever the case, she looks wonderfully peaceful there beside you: lips slightly parted, long elven ears tucked back, ice-blonde hair tangled slightly and spread all over her back and shoulders. [etheryn.lowConfidence
